          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "two isolated CAN buses (CAN0, CAN1), each driven by its own MCP2515 SPI CAN controller ... through an isolated CAN transceiver (U11/companion)"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "The CAN interfaces lose their intended galvanic isolation, allowing ground differences and transients on the external bus to couple directly into the logic ground.",
      "confidence": 0.99
    },
    {
      "category": "wrong_value",
      "components": ["R28"],
      "pins": ["R28.1", "R28.2"],
      "nets": ["+3V3", "SCL0_GPIO45"],
